: 1180, "title": "Review: Days", "radius": 44}, "Ref-AreaTimeline.dc.html": {"x": 1410, "y": 3732, "w": 390, "h": 1180, "title": "Area timeline", "radius": 44}, "Ref-Settings.dc.html": {"x": 1880, "y": 3732, "w": 390, "h": 1330, "title": "Settings", "radius": 44}, "Ref-RegularItem.dc.html": {"x": 2350, "y": 3732, "w": 390, "h": 844, "title": "Settings detail: regular item", "radius": 44}, "Ref-DeleteSheet.dc.html": {"x": 2820, "y": 3732, "w": 390, "h": 844, "title": "Delete: swipe and confirm", "radius": 44}, "Ref-ReviewEmpty.dc.html": {"x": 3290, "y": 3732, "w": 390, "h": 844, "title": "Empty state: Review", "radius": 44}, "DesignSystem.dc.html": {"x": 0, "y": 5462, "w": 1280, "h": 1900, "title": "Design system: Aurora ring", "radius": 32}}, "order": ["Main.dc.html", "Today-Blue.dc.html", "Today-Violet.dc.html", "Today-Violet-Dots.dc.html", "Palette.dc.html", "Today-Aurora.dc.html", "Today-Ring.dc.html", "Today-Signal.dc.html", "Today-AuroraRing.dc.html", "Sheet-Treatment.dc.html", "Meal-Choose.dc.html", "Meal-Review.dc.html", "More.dc.html", "Icons-Nails.dc.html", "Ref-Skin.dc.html", "Ref-DailyHealth.dc.html", "Ref-Review.dc.html", "Ref-AreaTimeline.dc.html", "Ref-Settings.dc.html", "Ref-RegularItem.dc.html", "Ref-DeleteSheet.dc.html", "Ref-ReviewEmpty.dc.html", "DesignSystem.dc.html"], "notes": {"t1": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Light and floating (updated to the current Today)", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 1800}, "t2": {"x": 0, "y": 944, "text": "New directions", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 1800}, "s1": {"x": 1880, "y": 1244, "w": 340, "fill": "teal", "size": "s", "text": "Aurora ring: gestures and rules\n\n\u2022 Swipe the ring left or right: previous or next day (arrows stay as faint buttons).\n\u2022 Tap the date in the centre: calendar picker.\n\u2022 Tap a dot: that entry's Edit or Delete sheet.\n\u2022 Swipe a log row left: Delete (tap still works).\n\u2022 Long-press a quick action: full form, skipping its quick sheet.\n\u2022 Later experiment: press and drag around the ring to pick a time, release, choose what to log.\n\nToday: at most 5 pinned quick actions + More. No search field, no one-tap treatment row. At most two context pills. Edit Today moves into More."}, "t3": {"x": 0, "y": 2188, "text": "Aurora ring: next screens", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 1800}, "s2": {"x": 1880, "y": 2488, "w": 340, "fill": "teal", "size": "s", "text": "Next screens: notes\n\n\u2022 Quick sheet: Regular items first, then Often used (the former one-tap shortcuts). A tap logs now, the row turns into \"Applied 14:20\" and is locked for 3 s. Other or earlier\u2026 opens the full form.\n\u2022 Forms: Cancel stays top left; Save is a floating pill at the bottom, in thumb reach, riding above the keyboard. No save gesture: swipe down stays Cancel.\n\u2022 Meal choose: type or pick; Scan, Label and Photo start the other routes. No Save yet: a pick or Continue moves to review.\n\u2022 Meal review: ingredient chips; allergens ticked from this meal's history, dashed guesses from the ingredient text (gluten from \"bread\"), the rest behind \"+ 11 more\".\n\u2022 More: search over entry types and the Where do I log situations; Edit Today lives here."}, "t4": {"x": 0, "y": 3432, "text": "Reference screens: one per pattern", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 3680}, "t5": {"x": 0, "y": 5162, "text": "Design system", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 1280}}, "designSystems": []}